                 |
          +------+------+
          |             |
          v             v
      Amazon EC2    Docker Image
                         |
                         v
                    Amazon ECR
                         |
                         v
                    Amazon ECS
                         |
                         v
                   Flask API
                         |
                         v
                  GET /health
```

**Note:** The EC2 deployment workflow and the ECR/ECS container deployment are separate deployment approaches. The GitHub Actions configuration provided uses SSH to execute `deploy.sh` on EC2; it does not itself demonstrate an ECR/ECS deployment.

